Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:52.02,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,This is the preview of the next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.02,0:23:54.26,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,of {\i1}The Iceblade Sorcerer \NShall Rule the World{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.99,0:23:58.79,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Amelia's heart wavers in light \Nof Ariane's overwhelming power!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.79,0:24:02.28,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,But life is never considerate and \Nbrings in an unexpected guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.28,0:24:05.49,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,"The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest \NSorcerer Inspires the Rose"!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.50,0:24:10.01,ep title,txt,0,0,0,,Episode 8\N{\fscx85}The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Inspires the Rose
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.67,0:24:09.24,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,This was Carol Caroline. Wink!
